# libre-panel
===
 Free, open-source software for the USB system-monitor panels sold as TURZX, Turing Smart Screen, WeAct, Kipye and more: video mode up to 50 fps, its own themes, cards, notices, game mode and an app to design your own. Works out of the box: sensors, fans, GPU and ffmpeg need no other program. Windows and Linux, no account, no cloud.
